  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preparation for HCFC phase-out investment activities (stage II) (foam sector)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preparation for investment project in foam and commercial refrigeration industry includes update on the consumption in the manufacturing sector companies of R-141b pure and in pre-blended with polyol, as well as assessment of feasibility of non-HCFC conversion technologies in PU foam and refrigeration equipment manufacturing with regard to commercial availability of climate-friendly alternatives technologies in spray foam/insulation.</narrative>
  </description>
